# Death to Our Enemies: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create a tapped Treasure token and put a plan counter on
# this enchantment. When the fourth plan counter is put on this enchantment, sacrifice it. When you do, it deals 7 damage
# divided as you choose among one or two targets." Bot1 casts it with Black Lotus's mana (the Lotus, cast before, is no
# trigger), then Ornithopter (a creature spell: nothing) and three Moxes: three tapped Treasures and three plan counters.
# Bot2's Mox Ruby on turn 2 is not Bot1's spell: nothing. Bot1's fourth noncreature spell, Mox Emerald on turn 3, makes a
# fourth Treasure and puts the fourth plan counter on it: it is sacrificed, and the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) deals 5
# to Bot2 and 2 to Bot2's Ornithopter, divided as it was put on the stack (CR 601.2d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Death to Our Enemies
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Death to Our Enemies.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Death to Our Enemies.Counters.Plan = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Death to Our Enemies.Counters.Plan = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield = Death to Our Enemies; Mountain; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Treasure Token; Treasure Token; Treasure Token
? Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token#3.Tapped = true
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Death to Our Enemies.Counters.Plan = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Divide(Bot2: 5; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter: 2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Death to Our Enemies; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Ornithopter; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Treasure Token; Treasure Token; Treasure Token; Treasure Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token#4.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token#4.Token = true
